From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:54:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] POC-11f: trainers as Navi rivals - NaviCust programs
 and Emerald AI move choice

Gym Leaders, the rival, Elite Four, Champion and team leaders run auto-laid-out
NaviCust programs by tier (bug-free only) and score moves with their own
gTrainers[].aiFlags (CheckBadMove, TryToFaint, CheckViability parts the grid can read).
Ordinary trainers and wild battles are unchanged (regression logs identical).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
